  _landmarkId: angkor-wat
  _displayTitle: Angkor Wat
  _shortDescription: "12. y\xFCzy\u0131lda dev bir Hindu tap\u0131na\u011F\u0131
    olarak kurulan Angkor Wat, zamanla Budist bir kutsal alana d\xF6n\xFC\u015Ft\xFC.
    Be\u015F kuleli sil\xFCeti ve bir kilometreyi a\u015Fan kabartmalar\u0131yla
    d\xFCnyan\u0131n en b\xFCy\xFCk din\xEE an\u0131t komplekslerinden biridir. Bat\u0131ya
    d\xF6n\xFCk s\u0131ra d\u0131\u015F\u0131 plan\u0131 ve ta\u015Flara i\u015Flenen
    sava\u015F, saray ya\u015Fam\u0131 ve destan sahneleri, Khmer \u0130mparatorlu\u011Fu\u2019nun
    g\xFCc\xFCn\xFC ayr\u0131nt\u0131lar\u0131yla anlat\u0131r."
  _sector: "Siem Reap / KAMBO\xC7YA"
